# wie_validate --keys: the whole path in one run — home → settings (vibration off, level 쉬움,
# motion 켬 → 줄임 → 끔 → back to 켬) → help (all four pages) → start → play → CLR →
# "그만할까요?" 5 → home → start again → play (쉬움: more lines, so chains come up) until the
# time bar runs out → "시간 끝" card → CLR → home. Key names only; the board is random, so the
# moves are blind. The second round sweeps the board in a snake, trying a swap right and a swap
# down at each cell of the top four rows — lines, and so chains, come up far more often than
# swapping in place. The sweep ends well inside the 90 s round, so no key lands on the end card.
# Run: ../arcade-common/README.md §확인.
